Requirements
- Python/FastApi on port 8000
- read/write access to postgres
- webhooks from payment provider
- runs a daily batch job
- critical path for mobile app
- traffic peaks around 2-3k requests/sec in the
evenings
- Postgres is outside the cluster

questions
- batch job on the fastapi container or separate container?

Out of scope
- tuning db
- connection details

Decisions
- github actions are out due to billing issues
- python downgraded to 3.13 so inspector code security works (docs list support up to 3.13)
- liveness checks do not check the database.  readiness checks could, but only if the app doesn't do something useful when the db is unavailable (cached data, degraded serivice, error/maintenance page)
- regarding the note above, ALBs fail open when there are no healthy targets
- another option is a static maintenance page hosted in S3 as the lowest priority ALB route